+name: Guarantor required at the step — declared, blocked, then submits
+description: |
+  The canonical declared-required drive (2026-08-04 final policy) on the
+  STEPPED layout: a first-time renter must be pre-informed at the point of
+  selection, find the requirement declared on the Guarantor step, and be
+  blocked AT THE STEP — never surprised by errors at final submit.
+
+  With stepper: true (STEP_NAV_URL):
+
+  1. Fill About you; Continue. Fill Your situation; Continue.
+  2. Work & income: pick employment_status=employed first — assert NO
+     guarantor ahead-note appears (eval
+     `document.querySelector('[data-testid="guarantor-ahead-note-student"]').hidden === true`).
+     Then switch to student — assert the ahead-note APPEARS at the moment
+     of selection (`...hidden === false`). Switch BACK to employed (the
+     honest-conditional disappears with the choice) and complete the
+     section with the employer trio; Continue.
+  3. References: tick "I haven't rented before" — assert
+     [data-testid="guarantor-ahead-note-first-rental"] appears AT THAT
+     MOMENT (eval hidden === false), the landlord-ref group hides, and the
+     character-ref trio shows. Fill the character-ref trio. Untick and
+     re-tick once — the note must disappear and reappear with the choice
+     (honest-conditional both ways). Continue.
+  4. Guarantor step — the declared-required treatment, all four parts:
+     a. [data-testid="guarantor-required-notice-first-rental"] VISIBLE
+        (eval hidden === false).
+     b. [data-testid="guarantor-fields"] EXPANDED (hidden === false) with
+        no optional-checkbox gate (the checkbox wrapper is hidden:
+        eval `document.querySelector('[name="has_guarantor"]').closest('.conditional-field').hidden === true`).
+     c. NOTHING pre-ticked: eval
+        `document.querySelector('[name="has_guarantor"]').checked === false`.
+     d. STEP-LEVEL BLOCK: click [data-testid="step-continue-guarantor"]
+        with the fields empty — the stepper must NOT advance (eval the
+        guarantor section is still the visible step) and its gating
+        message shows inside the section. This is the bug's core: the
+        requirement holds HERE, not at final submit.
+  5. Fill all six guarantor fields (form_data), Continue to review,
+     consent, submit (after the anti-fraud delay) →
+     [data-testid="confirmation-page"].
+priority: critical
+tags: [stepper, guarantor, first-time-renter, declared-required, point-of-selection, regression]
+expected_outcome: confirmation
