+- [x] Real-browser evidence (Chromium, iPhone-14 mobile viewport, local server): prep-block checklist line; student pick → ahead-note appears/disappears (honest-conditional both ways); never-rented tick → ahead-note appears/disappears/reappears; declared Guarantor step (notice visible, fields expanded, checkbox gate hidden, box unchecked); step-level block (Continue held, "This one's needed before you continue."); required submits (first-rental/student/unemployed) → banner leads with the per-cohort requirement statement + 6 field errors, re-render keeps notice + expanded fields; DB pins — required-cohort row persisted has_guarantor=t + all six fields + guarantor_attestation acknowledgement written (no checkbox posted); retired hint + optional unticked box → clean confirmation; optional kept-on-error round-trip (5 errors, state retained); check→uncheck desync (error re-render: zero guarantor rows, box unchecked, block hidden, trace cleared → fix → confirmation); first-time-renter + stacked-conditionals happy paths → confirmation; no-JS SSR renders all notices + retired hint with the box never pre-ticked and "usually a parent" absent.
+- [ ] PR with Decisions & rationale, counsel-pack flag, class-audit report, final copy
+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given any required cohort, when the applicant reaches the Guarantor step, then the requirement is declared (notice + fields expanded + no checkbox gate + nothing pre-ticked) and the stepper blocks empty fields AT THE STEP.
+- Given any required cohort with filled guarantor fields and no checkbox posted, when submitted, then it validates, persists has_guarantor=true with fields, and writes the attestation record.
+- Given an optional cohort, when the box is unticked (even after an earlier check or an unrelated error re-render), then the box never self-marks and the submit is clean.
+- Given an optional cohort with box ticked and empty fields, when submitted, then the 6 errors fire and the re-render keeps the checked state and partial values.
+- Given the point-of-selection triggers, when the applicant ticks never_rented or picks student/unemployed, then the inline note appears at that moment and disappears when the choice is unmade.
+- Given every checklist surface, when rendered, then the same guarantor line appears and "usually a parent" appears nowhere.
+- Given the full suites, when `make format && make test && make build` and `make test-integration` run, then all green.
