+## Spec Change Log
+
+- 2026-08-04 (human renegotiation 1 — Option A ruling via Gru relay): force_required is a DELIBERATE vetting bundle; "retire the rule" reading rejected. Keep the rule, fix the UX incoherence (declared-required UX, step-level block); desync class-audit downgraded to report-only. Amended: Intent, Boundaries, Matrix, Tasks. KEEP: the investigation (draft layer verified clean) and the re-render-fidelity requirement.
